# Captures. `?shots=1&n=12` writes here, and so does every ad-hoc debug
# screenshot — 1.5 MB of them (boot.png, hud-0*.png) had accumulated at the
# repo root instead, where a stranger could not tell an artefact from an asset.
# The second rule is the one that stops it recurring; the first is where they
# belong, and where reports/README.md already says captures live.
reports/screens/*.png
/*.png
data/
